cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Microphone Array Localization: A Clean-Room MATLAB Simulation"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic MATLAB simulation for two-dimensional localization of one
  stationary synthetic source with configurable microphone geometry,
  independently implemented LMS and GCC-PHAT time-delay estimators, bounded
  nonlinear coordinate estimation, repeated SNR experiments, and explicit
  diagnostics and limitations.
